{"articleNo":"713","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=713&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"주전산기 데이터 이전 및 시스템 일시중지 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.25","hit":"16565","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>주전산기 데이터 이전&nbsp;및 시스템 일시중지&nbsp;알림</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. 우리대학교에서 운영중인 주전산기 및 각 서버들의 데이터를 다음과 같이 이전 작업및 시스템이 일시중지 되오니 업무에 참고하시고 협조를 부탁드립니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 이전계획</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 목적 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 신규 도입한 스토리지로 데이터 이전 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 메일, 인터넷디스크 용량 확보를 통한 제공 서비스 용량의 확대 지원&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">나. 일시 : ‘09.03.28(토) 10:00 ~ 03.29(일) 10:00</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 작업 시스템 명</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) kaiser(종합정보시스템)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) edms(전자결재시스템)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) arch(자료관)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) learing(통합교육시스템)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) app(웹응용시스템) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6) 기타서버 및 인터넷디스크 확장작업</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">&nbsp;<u>라. 인터넷 및 메일 서비스는 가능.</u></font></strong> </font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
